med_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/431703394","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4954#issuecomment-431703394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4954","id":431703394,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzMTcwMzM5NA==","user":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-10-21T20:58:39Z","updated_at":"2018-10-21T20:58:39Z","body":"It looks like the file has about 150 KB of non-MP3 data at the end. On 2.8.4 we handled the `ParserException` resulting from reaching it as non-fatal, then retried synchronization and hit the end of the stream, which was not treated as an error. On 2.9.0 the behavior changed to treat `ParserException` as a fatal exception, hence the error.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure how common it is to have a lot of non-MP3 data after the audio stream like this, and I haven't seen it before. If it is common we should probably add some special handling so it's not treated as an error. If your app needs to handle these particular streams you could handle `ParserException` and suppress the error.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/431703394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1916831686,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTkxNjgzMTY4Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1916831686","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/star